error[type-mismatch] 4:6-4:21
    (+ (get row :hits) 1))
       ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  This is an Option<Int>, but an Int is needed here.
  Expected: Int
  Found: Option<Int>
  The field :hits is optional: a tool declares it optional, or the records that reach this point do not all have it.
  Sx does not narrow a field by a flag such as :known, so testing a flag does not make :hits present.
  Match on it, or give get a default: (get row :hits DEFAULT).
  Fix: (match (get row :hits) (some hits) ... none ...)
